\newlabel{fig:field}{{4}{6}{E2-v1 --- measured family profiles and Belief--Claim Gap for both models after the preregistered token-budget repair. Runs with $\ge 50\%$ mapped-unavailable turns are excluded rather than drawn as zero profiles, because the conservative mapping manufactures safe verdicts on censored turns. Per-family $\hat \beta =0$ with Wilson 95\% CI $[0,0.060]$; the interval, not the point estimate, is the result}{figure.4}{}}
